# Compiled binaries
/bonnie
/output/
/dist/

# Nix build symlinks
/result
/result-*

# direnv cache and the local .env it loads
/.direnv/
/.env

# go-task cache
/.task/

# Go workspace. BONNIE and Kit are separate repos, and nothing here needs a
# workspace: go.mod pins the Kit version, and the tests that compile a
# scaffolded tree write a replace into that tree's own go.mod. To work against
# Kit HEAD, use an uncommitted replace. CI runs with GOWORK=off so a stray
# workspace file cannot make a green local run lie.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Scratch agent trees. The repository root is a Go library, not an agent tree:
# a stray instructions.md, skills/, or workspace/ here belongs to someone's
# `bonnie init .` and is not part of the project.
/instructions.md
/skills/
/workspace/
/bonnie_gen.go

# Test and coverage output
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Local run journals and sandbox workspaces. The default journal root is
# .bonnie, and it holds full conversation content in plain text.
.bonnie/

# Journal files written outside the default root by an ad-hoc run.
*.jsonl

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
